Examples of cuFINUFFT usage in C++. Each is built and run as a test (ctest -R example_)
and exits nonzero on an accuracy error, NaN or Inf.

getting_started.cpp     1D type 1, single precision, plan interface (the docs walkthrough)
simple1d1.cu           1D type 1, simple interface, double precision
simple1d1f.cu          1D type 1, simple interface, single precision
simple2d1.cu           2D type 1, simple interface
many1d1.cu             1D type 1, simple interface, many transforms with the same points
guru1d1.cu             1D type 1, guru (plan) interface, double precision
guru1d1f.cu            1D type 1, guru (plan) interface, single precision
guru2d1.cu             2D type 1, guru (plan) interface
gurumany1d1.cu         1D type 1, guru (plan) interface, many transforms
example2d1many.cu      2D type 1, batch of transforms with the same points, single precision
example2d2many.cu      2D type 2, batch of transforms with the same points, double precision
example2d3many.cu      2D type 3, batch of transforms with the same points, double precision
simulplans1d1.cu       1D type 1, two plans alive at once
spreadinterponly1d.cu  1D spread-only and interpolate-only (gpu_spreadinterponly) tasks
threadsafe1d1.cu       1D type 1, one plan and CUDA stream per thread
threadsafe2d2f.cu      2D type 2, single precision, one plan and CUDA stream per thread

See ../../python/cufinufft/examples for Python and ../../matlab/examples/cuda for MATLAB.
More usage examples: ../../test/cuda/cufinufft*.cu
